  "description": "🚀 Turn any Google Maps search into a ready-to-use business lead list. Simply enter a 🔎 search term, choose a 📍 location, and select how many businesses you want to extract.\n\n📦 The Base Plan gives you essential business data and available 📧 emails. For deeper prospecting, optionally turn on 🏢 Company Insights or 📞 Phone Numbers & Phone Details to enrich your results with additional information.\n\n💳 Only pay for the data you need, select the add-ons you want and start extracting.",
